<title>UK: New Zealand sets $300 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>New Zealand sets $300 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Nikko</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    24.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1315  PAY DATE    24.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.944    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
